This research sharing package includes selected runtime source files from:
MyoAssist, NeuMove Lab, Northeastern University
https://github.com/neumovelab/myoassist
Baseline commit: b1baf69da59dc6728515d0977cbc8fbf00b9225a

The original Apache-2.0 license is retained in LICENSE.
Selected MyoAssist runtime files are copied without modification.
Research additions provide TCP/JSON control, ROS 2 bridging, visualization,
logging and evaluation. Test-only interpreter selection changes are documented
in results/runtime_source_provenance.json.

MS-Human-700 models, msgym environments, DynSyn-SAC, MyoSuite and other
third-party dependencies are attributed in docs/SCOPE_AND_SOURCES.md.
These assets and checkpoints are obtained from their official sources and
are not bundled as original work of this sharing package.
